        "bootstrap": [
          "static/gsApp/registerOverrides.tsx#registerGsAppOverrides",
          "static/app/bootstrap/commonInitialization.tsx#commonInitialization(__initialData)"
        ],
        "defines": {
          "process.env.USE_TANSTACK_DEVTOOL": false,
          "process.env.IS_ACCEPTANCE_TEST": false,
          "process.env.ENABLE_SENTRY_TOOLBAR": false,
          "process.env.EXPERIMENTAL_SPA": false
        },
        "maxFiberCount": 20000
      },
      "notes": "index.tsx boots asynchronously: in SaaS mode it registers the getsentry overrides, loads the /api/client-config/ payload (window.__initialData, captured from the live page) into ConfigStore and then calls renderDom(Main), so the static side runs the same bootstrap before rendering the exported Main component. UI-only mode serves the SPA over a self-signed https certificate; the login page fetches from sentry.io and logs 403s for unauthenticated endpoints."
    },
    {
      "id": "posthog",
      "repository": "https://github.com/PostHog/posthog",
